
  <sn><md>### Php set up in Linux

![img](https://agaetis.tech/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/How-to-Install-Linux-Server-for-php-and-MySql.png)

```text
PHP + Apache + MySQL/MariaDB + phpMyAdmin
```

Assuming you use **Ubuntu**, the simplest PHP development environment is:
